# The corner TV example after a solve: the Solver tab; the default layout
# with A selected; the sheets of a point and of a criterion in a taller
# Properties; the Criteria panel in a wider right column, where the
# formulas fit.
open tests/data/tv_corner_ref.json
solve
panel solver
wait 29
shot solver.ppm
panel constraints
select design A
wait 16
shot overview.ppm
# The border between the canvas and the panels under it, dragged up; the
# pointer then leaves it, which would stay highlighted.
drag L 300 691 300 420
move 1590 10
wait 16
shot point.ppm
select criterion link_angle
wait 16
shot criterion.ppm
action edit.clear_selection
panel criteria
# The border between the left column and the right one, dragged left.
drag L 1023 300 700 300
move 1590 10
wait 16
shot criteria.ppm
